{
  "name": "paged",
  "integration": "cisco-secure-endpoint",
  "description": "Two-page offset walk with page_size=2. Page 1 returns a full page so a second call must be issued carrying offset=2; page 2 is short, which is the documented stop condition, so no third call may be made. The active_only filter is on, proving a filtered-out row still counts toward the page-fullness test (it is the raw row count, not the kept count, that drives pagination) and that dropping it does not truncate the walk.",
